즐거워하리이다"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["여호와여, 주는 의인에게 복을 주시고 방패로 함 같이 은혜로 저를 호위하시리이다"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kor_old/PSA/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kor_old/PSA/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kor_old/PSA/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}